# Phase 4: the FRAME GENERATION row when generation can't run: run with
# --extra --frame_generation_debug_fail=1. Turned on, generation fails, the row reads OFF
# (FAILED) and can't be changed, and FPS TARGET stays the normal list.
wait 8s
mark title
press_until start left_title every=2s timeout=90s
mark map_zoom
wait_until roam 180s
mark settle
wait 3s
press start 4f
wait 2s
press rb 4f
wait 1s
press rb 4f
wait 1s
press down 4f
wait 700ms
press down 4f
wait 700ms
press down 4f
wait 700ms
press down 4f
wait 1s
press a 4f
wait 1500ms
get frame_generation frame_generation_available frame_generation_why
press down 4f
wait 1s
press right 4f
wait 3s
get frame_generation frame_generation_available frame_generation_why
press right 4f
wait 1500ms
press left 4f
wait 1500ms
get frame_generation frame_generation_available frame_generation_why mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation
press up 4f
wait 1s
press right 4f
wait 1500ms
get mcla_fps mcla_fps_frame_generation
press b 4f
wait 2s
mark end
wait 1s
